## Key Decisions
| Phase | Decision | Choice | Rationale | Date |
|-------|----------|--------|-----------|------|
| 1 | Scope classification | Epic (reclassified from Large) | 8 decomposable stories, 3+ independent integration points, clear parallelism, natural E2E gates | 2026-03-26 |
| 1 | Agent isolation | Container per agent | Strong isolation, cost-effective, easy to scale to N agents | 2026-03-26 |
| 1 | Meta-repo strategy | tech-dev-agents defines agents, not worked on by them | Clean separation of agent config from target work | 2026-03-26 |
| 1 | Repo access model | Explicit grant per agent | Security boundary — no blanket access | 2026-03-26 |
| 1 | Approval flow | Teams conversation at phase gates | User stays in the loop without context-switching from Teams | 2026-03-26 |

